      "Name": "GPT-6 Luna Decisions",
      "Description": "OpenAI's Decisions API (POST https://api.openai.com/v1/decisions), public beta since October 6, 2026, served by GPT-6 Luna, the only model it supports. It answers Likelihood (predicate), Choice and Score questions with typed answers and a probability for every option or level, about text or image input; MJ sends text only. It writes no text. OpenAI has not published limits on questions per call, options, levels or input size. OpenAI states the API answers up to 10 times faster than GPT-6 Luna through the Responses API; that is OpenAI's claim, not an MJ measurement. Its raw probabilities are not calibrated to MJ's data, so set thresholds on calibrated values.",
